Files adapted from DAWE, with modifications:

  code/formatter_exps_gp.py
    From gpu/app.py (train, generate, weight_map, the version pins and the price table) and
    gpu/lab.py (decision_map, as plan_map and points_for). Changes: a `seed` argument for SFT
    (DAWE hard-codes 0); an `enforce_eager` argument for generation, with predictions also written
    to the volume; weight_map can skip the backward pass (grads=False; the saved states are the
    same); plan_map reads prebuilt plan-first SFT rows instead of rendering BFCL in the container;
    optional install of DAWE's recorded package freezes (FEP_IMAGE=freeze); tighter timeouts;
    telemetry off; app and volume names configurable by environment variable; new functions and
    entry points for the replication (merge_adapter, gen_arms, stage1, stage2, stage2_s1,
    s3_merge_planmap, stage3, step2).

  code/prevent.py
    From gpu/app.py (train, generate). Changes: optional trainable decision-token rows (PEFT
    trainable_token_indices, rows in fp32, a second optimizer group), untied output/input splits,
    assertions, and the same environment-variable names as above.

  code/arms.py
    New code (the arm runner: in-place row patches and swaps, read-back checks, constant-bias and
    two-pass first-token decoding). Its vLLM engine and sampling settings are taken from
    gpu/app.py::generate.

  code/req_train.txt, code/req_vllm.txt
    Copies of DAWE's recorded package freezes (repro/freeze_*.txt).

  code/fit_xml_patch.py, code/fit_planfirst_patch.py
    Re-implement the ridge fits of DAWE's sessions/s1/edits/eos12.py and
    sessions/s2/edits/plan8_eos12.py on my own checkpoints' hidden states (on CPU in fp32; DAWE's
    ran on CUDA), plus same-norm random controls and the transplant of DAWE's released deltas.

  code/scoring/score_items.py
    A per-item wrapper around DAWE's own scorer (dawe.bfcl, dawe.harness). It imports DAWE and
    must run inside a DAWE checkout.

  code/their_patch_deltas.py
    Reads DAWE's released patches (release/patches/*.gpatch) with dawe.patch.load_patch.

Other third-party material:

  data/
    Prompts and gold replies built with DAWE's `dawe build-sft`, `build-eval` and `build-pairs`
    from the Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard v3 (Apache-2.0,
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/gorilla-llm/Berkeley-Function-Calling-Leaderboard). The
    questions and function schemas remain subject to the BFCL license.

  results/
    Per-item outputs of Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B fine-tunes (Apache-2.0) on BFCL items, scored with DAWE's
    scorer. results/deltas/*.pt contain DAWE's released patch deltas (from
    release/patches/s1_eos12.gpatch and s2_plan8_eos12.gpatch) alongside my own fits.
